 who she's had a crush on for 6 months. However, Dojin is unable to recognize Sujung on the street and passes by her. Shocked by this, Sujung is unable to go to class and runs off to the gym's storage. There, she meets Jaehyun, who promises to help Sujung and Dojin get closer... How? By making a grand scheme to seduce her crush with his younger brother!","year":2023,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"63","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/388c0850-25fe-444c-adc7-77bb813ec7cf/6bc4a892-aa5b-4e47-a71f-b8881eabde93.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.88,"follows":220,"listAt":"2026-10-22T13:05:53.694Z","chapters":[{"id":"def5e568-818f-43e3-a077-6f045b353997","number":"6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:16:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"541a1416-47da-4d7f-8e19-623cebd5d32a","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:15:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ae8a810c-b427-4d93-b473-689aa495ea00","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:14:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"19acaf9a-b45a-45fd-ac6f-c42e85893446","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:13:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b0293b7c-7404-4669-b9bc-e328dfc73189","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:05:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"22f1d7d8-74e1-4046-85a5-22658b584b98","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":60,"createdAt":"2024-03-09T01:04:17+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":6,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:32:14.846Z"},"6d4e768d-d68a-449f-8983-f7acbc160d9c":{"id":"6d4e768d-d68a-449f-8983-f7acbc160d9c","title":"Kara no Kyoukai: The Garden of Sinners","altTitle":"Boundary of Emptiness","description":"A very popular early work from Kinoko Nasu from the Tsukihime & Fate fame, the Kara no Kyoukai universe has meet great success as an animated film adaptation, novels and radio dramas.  \r\n  \r\nKara no Kyoukai depicts a world where the true dark nature of the human being is being reviewed and exposed by shocking and ruthless events, and in the center of it all we have Ryougi Shiki, the true heir to the long lived, wealthy and mysterious Ryougi clan and Kokuto Mikiya, a would be normal high school student if it wouldn't be for his amazing deductive & investigative progress.  \r\n  \r\nThe moment Kokuto and Shiki meet is the moment that the wheel of fate started to turn, however is this fate moving forward naturally on it's own accord, or is it all being orchestrated from behind the scenes by an enigmatic persona? Only time will tell.","year":2010,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Adventure","Drama","Horror","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6d4e768d-d68a-449f-8983-f7acbc160d9c/1166b5e5-2aa1-4865-978e-99883d7d82fa.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es","ru","en","ar","fr","es-la","pl"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.49,"follows":5107,"listAt":"2026-10-22T13:05:43.008Z","chapters":[{"id":"30138dfc-8efa-423d-a8b2-1314b8dd1fa9","number":"73","volume":null,"title":"Plot 6 - Oblivion Recorder Part 17","lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T21:49:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a8ed0355-48e2-4ecd-ba66-f85b3a01d7c3","number":"72","volume":null,"title":"Plot 6 - Oblivion Recorder Part 16","lang":"en","pages":21,"createdAt":"2024-10-19T05:41:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d476ab41-97e1-4fdd-80a6-65a0263f2f8a","number":"71","volume":"12","title":"Plot 6 - Oblivion Recorder Part 15","lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2024-05-04T18:17:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"32c63881-bbb3-451c-a7d6-e2ea3ae0f1a3","number":"70","volume":"12","title":"Plot 6 - Oblivion Recorder Part 14","lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2024-03-