 had the combat power of an S-rank adventurer, the highest rank in the world. In fact, Rick has lived an unimaginable life with the members of the legendary Orihalcon Fist, a party of the continent's strongest adventurers. From dragons to vampires, Rick's fighting prowess, trained by his literally \"monster\" mentors, allows him to defeat elite adventurers one after another who try to underestimate him.\n___\n**Character Designer:** [Tea](https://mangadex.org/author/71d4c549-2476-4803-a9c2-c48a15cc0fd4)","year":2019,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Comedy","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a2320293-f00e-43a0-8d08-1110cf26a894/2a14f8a0-a9d1-4591-ab3b-164cefbdcf5f.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","es-la","en","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.33,"follows":52611,"listAt":"2026-10-22T13:05:15.574Z","chapters":[{"id":"95e27925-7a49-4651-ae2e-0d2d8bcd2124","number":"64","volume":"11","title":"You Won't Notice Hell when You're Already in It","lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2025-03-06T02:50:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"18984bcb-f5bd-4b34-825f-797eab390321","number":"63","volume":"11","title":"Cracks of the Heart","lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2025-03-04T02:53:04+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5984eab3-d004-42c4-93d8-1e4b0db7dbdc","number":"62","volume":"11","title":"The Way the Kingdom's Army Clears a Dungeon","lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2025-03-03T00:13:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c84602af-3550-47e7-8ed5-9245505e0a85","number":"61","volume":"11","title":"The Way S-Rankers Clear a Dungeon","lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2024-12-02T00:44:32+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"df31fd1c-6bae-416b-a8ff-560818e0460c","number":"60","volume":"11","title":"A Country Where Light and Dark Coexist","lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2024-12-02T00:43:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7314819f-0d90-4397-b372-dccdb39a8c10","number":"59","volum